{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_spawn", "label": "system.spawn / context.spawn", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Names must be unique among siblings and belong to the spawn call, never to the actor.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_class_or_factory", "label": "Klassenform und Factory-Form", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "An instance is rejected because the actor is rebuilt on every restart \u2014 reusing one means inheriting the broken state of the failed run, the opposite of let-it-crash; a closure returning a captured instance defeats it in a way the type system cannot catch.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_spawnanonymous", "label": "spawnAnonymous", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_actoroptions", "label": "ActorOptions", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Everything beyond the defaults lives in the third argument; a plain object is the shorthand alternative to the fluent builder.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_builder_mutates_itself", "label": "Der Options-Builder ver\u00e4ndert sich selbst", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "withX returns this, so branching off a shared base mutates it; options are copied at spawn time, so changing a builder afterwards reconfigures no running actor.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_withsupervisorstrategy", "label": "withSupervisorStrategy", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Two strategies are in play per actor \u2014 the one in its spawn options handles its own failures, the class override handles its children's; resolution is spawn options, then parent override, then defaultStrategy, and because the parent applies it, all-for-one still spreads to siblings and the retry budget is counted per parent.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_withdispatcher", "label": "withDispatcher", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Giving one actor its own ThroughputDispatcher does not batch its messages \u2014 withThroughput is the knob for that.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_withthroughput", "label": "withThroughput", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "An upper bound, not a promise: a batch ends early on an empty mailbox, on stop or suspend, and on an empty throttle bucket.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_withmailboxcapacity", "label": "withMailboxCapacity (Spawn-Option)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "This is the call that introduces message loss \u2014 the mailbox is unbounded otherwise, and drop-head applies unless another policy is named.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_withmailbox", "label": "withMailbox (Spawn-Option)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "The factory runs once when the cell is built, so the mailbox survives every restart while only the Actor instance is rebuilt \u2014 messages enqueued before the crash are still there.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_withinternal", "label": "withInternal", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Marks an actor as tooling so system-wide instrumentation skips it \u2014 without it the DevTools hub traces itself and every batch returns as the payload of the next; application actors must not be marked.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_withdisplayname", "label": "withDisplayName", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "The spawn-site counterpart for actors with no subclass to override \u2014 a Behaviors actor, a sharding entity, a singleton; purely cosmetic, the path stays the identity everywhere routing or correlation happens.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_withentity", "label": "withEntity", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Public so a test bench can construct an entity that derives its persistenceId from this.entityId without a cluster behind it.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_spawn", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_class_or_factory", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_spawnanonymous", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_spawn", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_actoroptions", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_spawn", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_builder_mutates_itself", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_actoroptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_withsupervisorstrategy", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_actoroptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/spawning.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_spawning_withdispatch